只输出严格JSON，恰好包含id（metadata.id原样）、summary_zh（15到140个Unicode字符，通常40到100字）、category（枚举）、tags（2到5个不重复关键词，每个最多30字符）、confidence（0到1，仅自评）、insufficient_evidence（布尔）、evidence（1到3个对象，每个恰好包含paragraph_id、fact）、limitations（0到5个字符串）。只选择输入中长度20至120字符的完整片段编号；fact是该片段支持的中文事实转述。不要输出quote，不要自行抄写、拼接、删改或补造引用。程序会按编号附上原文。一个编号只用一次；最多3条证据。不得增加字段。
摘要和limitations保留会改变功能意义的前提、平台例外和限制：设密码后才认证、页面保持打开才提醒、依赖外部组件、估算不等于保证。只写已实现功能，不将规划当完成。证据不足就标记，不编造。
图像识别/分类不是媒体创作，没有贴切类别归other；量化、计算与领域研究归search-research，不因多智能体实现归agents-automation；模型/CLI适配与插件开发工具归coding-development；市场/精选目录按搜索发现归search-research。不要按附属同步、备份或评论功能分类。不要推断本机客户端等于本地模型。
摘要中的主要功能必须被所选片段支持。优先把改变用途含义的条件写进摘要，不能只藏在limitations。遇到“阶段1骨架”“cloud provider待实现”“匿名thread后续实现”等，摘要明确当前仅本地草稿/审批落盘，不说已实现匿名网络或云端发布。Codex/模型登录适配归coding-development；Oopz等语音房的对话连接归communication-integrations。自述兼容或性能用“作者称/README注明”，不冒充本次验证。
格式示例（仅结构，不是来源事实）：evidence:[{"paragraph_id":"p3s1","fact":"该片段支持的中文转述"}]。请从本次真实输入挑选编号。","role":"system"},{"content":"{"metadata":{"description":"The first vision plugin for DeepSeek Harness, and the vision bridge for every text-only coding agent. Paste an image, get structured JSON evidence (OCR, layout, semantics). | 全网最强 DeepSeek Harness 外挂视觉插件，为 DeepSeek、GLM 等纯文本模型外挂视觉能力，粘贴图片即得结构化 JSON 证据（OCR、版面、语义）。","id":"gh:1163808211","install_available":true,"language":"TypeScript","name":"modlens","slug":"liustack/modlens","topics":["agent-skills","claude-code","claude-skills","codex","cordis","deepseek","dsh","dsh-plugin","glm","harness","harness-engineering","hermes-agent","image-to-text","multimodal","ocr","openclaw","pi-agent","text-only-llm","vision","vision-transformer"]},"paragraphs":[{"id":"p1s1","text":"The first vision plugin for DeepSeek Harness, and the vision bridge for every text-only coding agent"},{"id":"p1s2","text":". Paste an image, get structured JSON evidence (OCR, layout, semantics). | 全网最强 DeepSeek Harness 外挂视"},{"id":"p1s3","text":"觉插件，为 DeepSeek、GLM 等纯文本模型外挂视觉能力，粘贴图片即得结构化 JSON 证据（OCR、版面、语义）。"},{"id":"p2s1","text":"ModLens"},{"id":"p3s1","text":"Give a text-only model sight, and just paste the image."},{"id":"p4s1","text":"🥇 The most capable vision plugin for DeepSeek Harness (dsh) 🥇"},{"id":"p5s1","text":"简体中文 ·\nConfiguration ·\nTroubleshooting ·\nSecurity ·\n🔍 ModSearch (the best free web search plugin for"},{"id":"p5s2","text":"·\nConfiguration ·\nTroubleshooting ·\nSecurity ·\n🔍 ModSearch (the best free web search plugin for DSH)"},{"id":"p6s1","text":"DeepSeek's flagship chat models, and GLM-5.3 itself, are text-only and cannot read images. GLM-5.3-F"},{"id":"p6s2","text":"lash is native multimodal. ModLens is a plug-in vision engine that gives a text-only model sight. **"},{"id":"p6s3","text":"ModLens reads images pasted straight into the chat**, no saving to a file and passing a path first."},{"id":"p7s1","text":"## Talk to us"},{"id":"p8s1","text":"Issues are welcome any time: open one. Follow the liustack WeChat official account, and come find me"},{"id":"p8s2","text":" on X: **@liustack**. What you built with it, which harness you are on, and what should come next ar"},{"id":"p8s3","text":"e all shared on WeChat and X. A proper community space is on the way."},{"id":"p9s1","text":"## Highlights"},{"id":"p10s1","text":"**🥇 The most capable vision plugin for DeepSeek Harness (dsh):** install it instantly with one comma"},{"id":"p10s2","text":"nd: `npx -y @deepseek-ai/dsh plugin --profile web add @liustack/modlens@3.27.3`. See the setup guide"},{"id":"p10s3","text":" for installation and update details. If the command line is not your thing but you still want to tr"},{"id":"p10s4","text":"y DSH, check out AIManager, the lightest desktop wrapper for DeepSeek Harness. It gets you started w"},{"id":"p10s5","text":"ith zero code or configuration and installs every dependency for you with one click."},{"id":"p11s1","text":"Pasting an image works two ways. **① Just paste.** On a text-only model the pasted image lands as a "},{"id":"p11s2","text":"private temp file and its path enters the composer (the same interaction OpenCode and Pi ship), then"},{"id":"p11s3","text":" the `modlens_read_image` tool takes it from there. **② Pick a `(modlens vision)` entry** in the mod"},{"id":"p11s4","text":"el selector (it remembers your choice, so once is enough), then paste: the thumbnail stays visible i"},{"id":"p11s5","text":"n your message, closer to the Codex app feel, and the image is converted to structured evidence at r"},{"id":"p11s6","text":"equest time, answered by the same underlying route. The plugin auto-discovers every provider route c"},{"id":"p11s7","text":"arrying eligible text-only DeepSeek, GLM, or MiMo Pro models and adds a wrapped entry per route. A s"},{"id":"p11s8","text":"tock install gets **`DeepSeek-V4-Flash (modlens vision)`** and **`DeepSeek-V4-Pro (modlens vision)`*"},{"id":"p11s9","text":"*, while extra routes like opencode-go or zai get their own. Native vision models in those families,"},{"id":"p11s10","text":" including GLM-5.3-Flash, are excluded automatically. Which paste route applies is the host's per-mo"},{"id":"p11s11","text":"del call: only a model its metadata positively confirms text-only is taken over, anything unconfirme"},{"id":"p11s12","text":"d is left alone, so vision models keep their native paste (details)."},{"id":"p12s1","text":"**Paste images directly in every harness.** No saving to a file and passing a path first."},{"id":"p13s1","text":"A hotkey that captures the screen into DeepSeek Harness is a separate plugin: dsh-screenshot."},{"id":"p14s1","text":"- **The lightest touch on the market.** No hooks, no wrappers, no local proxy daemon, not a single l"},{"id":"p14s2","text":"ine changed in any harness config: on the skill harnesses it is exactly one skill folder, on dsh exa"},{"id":"p14s3","text":"ctly one plugin. Uninstalling is deleting a folder, and your agents are back to stock.\n[该节后续省略]"},{"id":"p15s1","text":"## Install in other harnesses"},{"id":"p16s1","text":"**Option 1, install with skills.sh:**"},{"id":"p17s1","text":"[代码示例省略，未执行]"},{"id":"p18s1","text":"This installs the `modlens` skill at user level. Restart the harness, then ask\nyour AI to configure "},{"id":"p18s2","text":"modlens and run its health check."},{"id":"p19s1","text":"**Option 2, hand the install to your AI.** Send it this line:"},{"id":"p20s1","text":"> Install and configure the modlens skill following https://github.com/liustack/modlens/blob/main/IN"},{"id":"p20s2","text":"STALL.md, then run the health check and tell me the result."},{"id":"p21s1","text":"The install starts by checking what your machine already has. An existing login in Claude Code, Code"},{"id":"p21s2","text":"x, OpenCode, or Pi can be enough: modlens asks before reusing any of them, and the health check tell"},{"id":"p21s3","text":"s you where things stand."},{"id":"p22s1","text":"**After either option, only if the health check comes back empty, set up a free engine.** The recomm"},{"id":"p22s2","text":"ended choice is a free Gemini API key (about three minutes at Google AI Studio, no credit card), whi"},{"id":"p22s3","text":"ch also makes every read 5-10 seconds. A free OpenAI-compatible key from another platform works too."},{"id":"p22s4","text":" To avoid any sign-up, install Antigravity CLI instead, then sign in:"},{"id":"p23s1","text":"[代码示例省略，未执行]"},{"id":"p24s1","text":"The install also inventories vision reachable through your other local harness CLIs (Codex, OpenCode"},{"id":"p24s2","text":", Pi) and asks, per harness, whether modlens may reuse it. Granted logins join the engine pool as eq"},{"id":"p24s3","text":"uals, and every reused read is labeled with whose quota it spent."},{"id":"p25s1","text":"[该节后续省略]"},{"id":"p26s1","text":"## Usage"},{"id":"p27s1","text":"[该节后续省略]"},{"id":"p28s1","text":"## Vision engines: six built-in providers, four reusable CLIs, one failover chain"},{"id":"p29s1","text":"[该节后续省略]"},{"id":"p30s1","text":"### Reusing what your machine already has"},{"id":"p31s1","text":"Two more sources of vision need zero new keys, each behind one explicit consent recorded in config:"},{"id":"p32s1","text":"- **The harness you are talking in right now.** Running inside Claude Code with a subscription signe"},{"id":"p32s2","text":"d in? `claude-cli` reads images through it out of the box. The install flow asks the same question f"},{"id":"p32s3","text":"or whichever harness you install into.\n- **Every other agent CLI on the machine.** `modlens doctor` "},{"id":"p32s4","text":"discovers them, you grant per harness, and they join the same failover chain with no priority over y"},{"id":"p32s5","text":"our own keys. Every reused read is labeled in `meta.warnings` with whose quota it spent, so nothing "},{"id":"p32s6","text":"is ever silently billed:"},{"id":"p33s1","text":"| Reused CLI | What it needs | Grant with | Rides as |\n| :-- | :-- | :-- | :-- |\n| Codex | a signed-"},{"id":"p33s2","text":"in Codex CLI with a vision model | `config set reuse.codex true` | agent lane, 15-45s |\n| OpenCode |"},{"id":"p33s3","text":" a vision model configured in OpenCode | `config set reuse.opencode true` | agent lane, 15-45s |\n| P"},{"id":"p33s4","text":"i | model credentials held by Pi | `config set reuse.pi true` | an API key upgrades to the 5-10s inl"},{"id":"p33s5","text":"ine lane, OAuth drives Pi itself |\n| Grok | a signed-in Grok CLI (SuperGrok) | `config set reuse.gro"},{"id":"p33s6","text":"k true` | agent lane, 15-45s |"}],"truncated":true}","role":"user"}],"model":"MiniMax-M3.1-Flash","reasoning_effort":"low","stream":false}
